msgstr "Consellos e truques"

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:341
msgid ""
"Use Internet-Keywords and Web-Shortcuts: by typing \"gg: KDE\" one can "
"search the Internet, using Google, for the search phrase \"KDE\". There are "
"a lot of Web-Shortcuts predefined to make searching for software or looking "
"up certain words in an encyclopedia a breeze. You can even <a href=\"%1"
"\">create your own</a> Web-Shortcuts."
msgstr ""
"Uso de Palabras chave e Atallos web: se escrebe \"gg: KDE\", pode procurar "
"en Internet, mediante Google, a palabra \"KDE\". Hai moitos atallos web "
"predefinidos para procurar programas ou termos en enciclopedias. Mesmo pode "
"<A HREF=\"%1\">crear os seus proprios</A> atallos web."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:346
msgid ""
"Use the magnifier button <img width='16' height='16' src=\"%1\"></img> in "
"the toolbar to increase the font size on your web page."
msgstr ""
"Use o botón de aumento <img width='16' height='16' src=\"%1\"></img> th='16' "
"heigt='16' src=\"%1\">ncrementar o tamaño das letras na páxina web."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:348
msgid ""
"When you want to paste a new address into the Location toolbar you might "
"want to clear the current entry by pressing the black arrow with the white "
"cross <img width='16' height='16' src=\"%1\"></img> in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Cando vostede queira apegar un enderezo na barra de enderezos podería querer "
"limpar a entrada actual premendo na frecha negra coa cruz branca <img "
"width='16' height='16' src=\"%1\"></img> na barra de ferramentas."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:352
msgid ""
"To create a link on your desktop pointing to the current page, simply drag "
"the \"Location\" label that is to the left of the Location toolbar, drop it "
"on to the desktop, and choose \"Link\"."
msgstr ""
"Para crear unha ligazón no seu escritorio apuntando á páxina actual, "
"simplemente arrastre a etiqueta \"Enderezo\" que se atopa á esquerda da "
"barra de enderezos, déixea sobre o ecritorio e escolla \"Ligar\"."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:355
msgid ""
"You can also find <img width='16' height='16' src=\"%1\" /> \"Full-Screen "
"Mode\" in the Settings menu. This feature is very useful for \"Talk\" "
"sessions."
msgstr ""
"Tamén pode atopar <img width='16' height='16' src=\"%1\" />o \"Modo pantalla "
"completa\" no menú de configuración. Esta característica é moi útil para "
"sesións de \"Conversa\"."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:358
msgid ""
"Divide et impera (lat. \"Divide and conquer\") - by splitting a window into "
"two parts (e.g. Window -> <img width='16' height='16' src=\"%1\" /> Split "
"View Left/Right) you can make Konqueror appear the way you like. You can "
"even load some example view-profiles (e.g. Midnight Commander), or create "
"your own ones."
msgstr ""
"Divide et impera (do lat. \"Divide e conquire\") - dividindo a fiestra en "
"dúas partes (p.ex. Fiestra -> <img width='16' height='16' src=\"%1\" /"
">Dividir a fiestra en esquerda/dereita) pode facer que Konqueror se axuste "
"aos seus gustos. Pode mesmo cargar algún perfil de vista de exemplo (p.ex. "
"Midnight Commander), ou crear os seus proprios."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:363
msgid ""
"Use the <a href=\"%1\">user-agent</a> feature if the website you are "
"visiting asks you to use a different browser (and do not forget to send a "
"complaint to the webmaster!)"
msgstr ""
"Use a funcionalidade <a href=\"%1\">user-agent</a> se o sitio web que está a "
"visitar requere un navegador diferente (e non esqueza enviar unha queixa ao "
"responsábel do sitio!)"

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:366
msgid ""
"The <img width='16' height='16' src=\"%1\"></img> History in your SideBar "
"ensures that you can keep track of the pages you have visited recently."
msgstr ""
"O <img width='16' height='16' src=\"%1\"></img> historial na súa barra "
"lateral garante non perderlle a pista ás páxinas visitadas recentemente."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:368
msgid ""
"Use a caching <a href=\"%1\">proxy</a> to speed up your Internet connection."
msgstr ""
"Empregue un <A HREF=\"%1\">proxy</A> caché para acelerar a conexón a "
"Internet."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:370
msgid ""
"Advanced users will appreciate the Konsole which you can embed into "
"Konqueror (Window -> <img width='16' height='16' SRC=\"%1\"></img> Show "
"Terminal Emulator)."
msgstr ""
"Os usuarios avanzados aprezarán Konsole, que se pode incluir en Konqueror "
"(Fiestra -> <img width='16' height='16' SRC=\"%1\"></img> Mostrar o emulador "
"de terminal)."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:373
msgid "<img width='16' height='16' src=\"%1\"></img>"
msgstr "<img width='16' height='16' src=\"%1\"></img>"

